    "title": "PA redesigned provisional ballot envelopes; number of rejected ballots declined - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Editorials ,\n1 days ago The 2025 election cycle saw a decrease in the number of ballot rejections due to envelope errors because of redesigned provisional ballot envelopes. Secretary of the Commonwealth Al Schmidt said counties using redesigned provisional ballot envelopes in the November 2025 election saw an 11.3 percent decrease in the number of provisional ballots that were rejected for envelope errors compared with the November 2024 election. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
